; The same two share legs priced two ways do not cancel: they sit in separate
; sums, so a price is still standing when hledger looks for an exchange and it
; refuses the file. Their costs do cancel, which is what makes this the sharp
; case: what is left over is two sides of opposite sign, and it is still not
; an exchange.
